I uploaded an example flight <https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1XcfMc3i8IV8NXuhzas7hvCDUnpQ2f7_B?usp=sharing> with the RGB and MS sensors. I included the exported datasheet, rasters, masks, shapefiles, and R code but if I'm missing anything let me know. I had removed the values that said NA and inf from the datasheet so now they are blank in the datasheet.

Thanks!

Eric

